00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:35,010
Boku ga sumu kono machi o,
kimi wa nani mo shiranai

218
00:22:35,450 --> 00:22:41,410
Boku ga koko ni iru wake sae mo

219
00:22:43,530 --> 00:22:56,340
Moshi, ano toki ga, furui renga no machi
nami ni somaru kotoga dekite itara

220
00:22:56,340 --> 00:22:59,710
Kimi o hanasa na katta

221
00:23:00,180 --> 00:23:07,980
Fuyu no hizashi o ukeru kouen o yoko gitte

222
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:14,220
Mainichi no seikatsu ga hajimaru

223
00:23:16,630 --> 00:23:24,500
Toki ga tomatta mama no boku no kokoro o

224
00:23:24,930 --> 00:23:30,840
Nikai date no bus ga oi koshite yuku

225
00:23:37,010 --> 00:23:40,540
I go to the house of psychics
Reika shows me.

226
00:23:41,020 --> 00:23:44,550
While the old lady is talking,
I remember various things,

227
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:47,990
and I realize that I always put Ryo in danger.

228
00:23:47,990 --> 00:23:49,530
As the old lady said,

229
00:23:49,530 --> 00:23:53,560
I might be a messenger from Hell,
guiding Ryo to death.

230
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:55,400
It might be better to disappear
than to be around him.

231
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:56,800
City Hunter 2:

232
00:23:56,800 --> 00:24:00,070
"Crystal Prophecy!
Chains of Memory Reviving in Kaori"

233
00:24:00,070 --> 00:24:01,800
If you miss it, I'll be depressed!

234
00:24:02,470 --> 00:24:06,430
Please look forward to the next episode